  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_01",
      "hash64": "7CA6F76767112817",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳太～慢了！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_02",
      "hash64": "7CA6F867671129CA",
      "text": "我們想趁阿栗還沒起床，\\n快把話說一說。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_gfather_01",
      "hash64": "CCF1168E029B9D2C",
      "text": "我試著修理\\n厄鬼椪的面具……[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_gfather_02",
      "hash64": "CCF1198E029BA245",
      "text": "但是若想要完全修理好，\\n還差一個素材。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_03",
      "hash64": "7CA6F96767112B7D",
      "text": "按照爺爺說的話……[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_04",
      "hash64": "7CA6F26767111F98",
      "text": "得要有沉在晶光池裡的\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]結晶碎片[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]才行。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_05",
      "hash64": "7CA6F3676711214B",
      "text": "雖然我們可以\\n就這樣把面具還回去。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_06",
      "hash64": "7CA6F467671122FE",
      "text": "但如果把面具修好再還，\\n厄鬼椪一定也會很高興的吧！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_select_01",
      "hash64": "8405B0BA68AFBAD7",
      "text": "我也覺得！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_select_02",
      "hash64": "8405B1BA68AFBC8A",
      "text": "妳真體貼",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_07",
      "hash64": "7CA6F567671124B1",
      "text": "聽了真正的故事以後，\\n就覺得……\\r\\n希望厄鬼椪能有一些好回憶。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_gfather_03",
      "hash64": "CCF1188E029BA092",
      "text": "知道有人在乎自己，\\n我相信厄鬼椪也一定會很高興的。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_08",
      "hash64": "7CA6EE67671118CC",
      "text": "是吧～！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_brother_01",
      "hash64": "3B4BF93BAADEB523",
      "text": "爺爺，早安。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_gfather_04",
      "hash64": "CCF1138E029B9813",
      "text": "早啊，烏栗。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_09",
      "hash64": "7CA6EF6767111A7F",
      "text": "阿栗！\\n你今天就去……[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_brother_02",
      "hash64": "3B4BFA3BAADEB6D6",
      "text": "知道了知道了。\\n隨便[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳們唄。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_10",
      "hash64": "7CAA7C6767143FED",
      "text": "什……什麼～！？\\n你再說一遍！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_brother_03",
      "hash64": "3B4BFB3BAADEB889",
      "text": "……我有事要做。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_11",
      "hash64": "7CAA7B6767143E3A",
      "text": "那傢伙從昨天開始\\n就好像在鬧什麼彆扭。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_gfather_05",
      "hash64": "CCF1128E029B9660",
      "text": "他晚飯也不吃，\\n就關在房間裡……[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_12",
      "hash64": "7CAA7A6767143C87",
      "text": "算了！反正他在青春期，\\n難免會有這種時候吧。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_13",
      "hash64": "7CAA796767143AD4",
      "text": "要是阿栗老黏著[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳，\\n我們就很難行動了，\\r\\n但現在這樣反而方便！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_14",
      "hash64": "7CAA786767143921",
      "text": "晶光池在鬼山的山頂。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_15",
      "hash64": "7CAA77676714376E",
      "text": "雖然讓外地人進到山裡去，\\n會讓我想到就覺得呃嗄～\\r\\n……算了！是[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的話我就不計較了。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_sister_16",
      "hash64": "7CAA7667671435BB",
      "text": "為了尋找結晶碎片，\\n我們let's go去爬山吧！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_gfather_06",
      "hash64": "CCF1158E029B9B79",
      "text": "晶光池那邊會出現強大的寶可夢，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要小心一點。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_student1_01",
      "hash64": "50F732182D96FB45",
      "text": "那３個看板\\n你們已經通通找到了！？\\c\\n我和丹瑜可是連\\n第２處都還沒能去耶！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_student2_01",
      "hash64": "A37171FC72A277B2",
      "text": "烏栗他心情不太好嗎？\\n我跟他搭話，他也沒注意到……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc01_0290_student3_01",
      "hash64": "7886FE07BBAF4367",
      "text": "好想泡在慶典裡一直玩！\\n可是課題也得要做啊～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
